      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْتَفْرِغَةٌ</span></b>  A she-camel <i>having much milk.</i> (O, K.
[See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِرَاغٌ</span>.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْتَفْرِغٌ</span> (tropical:)  A horse <i>that
does not reserve aught of his run</i> [i. e. <i>of his power
of running,</i> for the time of need; <i>that exhausts
his power thereof</i>]. (O, K, TA.)

